su name chirp source thrust verify to name text pass be ceremony def
  su name chirp source thrust write platform ob name text chirp source thrust request for name chirp source thrust verify mind to name text chirp source thrust review by num 0 atmost num 220 be write do
  ob text "false" to name text chirp source thrust pass be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust review from text "/\\bPASS\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp source thrust pass be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp source thrust verdict request begin platform ob text "VERIFIER_ANALYSIS:\n" to name text chirp source thrust verdict request be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust review to name text chirp source thrust verdict request be plus do
  ob name text chirp source thrust verdict request for name chirp source thrust verdict mind to name text chirp source thrust verdict raw by num 0 atmost num 8 be write do
  ob name text chirp source thrust verdict raw atmost num 1 to name text chirp source thrust verdict line be line tail do
  ob text "false" to name text chirp source thrust verdict known be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust verdict line from text "/^\\s*(PASS|FAIL)\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp source thrust verdict known be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust verdict line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp source thrust pass be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust verdict known be equally from text false then
  su name chirp source thrust verdict guarantee platform ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp source thrust verdict defective" be guarantee do
  su name chirp source thrust pass ret
prah

su name chirp source thrust from text source with text chirp to name text pass be ceremony def
  su name chirp source thrust source platform ob text of from of this to name text chirp source thrust source be text do
  su name chirp source thrust chirp platform ob text of with of this to name text chirp source thrust chirp be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust source to name text chirp replacement source be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust intent to name text chirp replacement intent be text do
  ob name text chirp source thrust chirp to name text chirp replacement chirp be text do
  su name chirp source thrust request platform ob name map chirp request replacements in name text chirp source thrust request template to name text chirp source thrust request be instead do
  su name pass platform to name text pass be chirp source thrust verify do
  su name pass ret
prah

