  su name chirp problem pool stage from text of ob of chirp source to name text chirp problem out be chirp problem pool fill do
  ob text "false" to name text chirp problem pool pass be text do
  ob name text chirp problem out from text "/\\w/" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp problem pool pass be text do
  ob name text chirp problem pool pass be equally from text false then
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be chirp problem pool retry do

  su name chirp cause pool stage from text of ob of chirp source to name text chirp cause out be chirp cause pool fill do
  ob text "false" to name text chirp cause pool pass be text do
  ob name text chirp cause out from text "/\\w/" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp cause pool pass be text do
  ob name text chirp cause pool pass be equally from text false then
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be chirp cause pool retry do

  su name chirp insight pool stage from text of ob of chirp source to name text chirp insight out be chirp insight pool fill do
  ob text "false" to name text chirp insight pool pass be text do
  ob name text chirp insight out from text "/\\w/" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp insight pool pass be text do
  ob name text chirp insight pool pass be equally from text false then
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be chirp insight pool retry do

  su name chirp proof pool stage from text of ob of chirp source to name text chirp proof out be chirp proof pool fill do
  su name chirp boundary pool stage from text of ob of chirp source to name text chirp boundary out be chirp boundary pool fill do

  ob name text chirp problem out to name text chirp replacement problem be text do
  ob name text chirp cause out to name text chirp replacement cause be text do
  ob name text chirp insight out to name text chirp replacement insight be text do
  ob name text chirp proof out to name text chirp replacement proof be text do
  ob name text chirp boundary out to name text chirp replacement boundary be text do

  ob name text chirp problem pool pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp problem guarantee platform ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp problem pool defective" be guarantee do
  ob name text chirp cause pool pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp cause guarantee platform ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp cause pool defective" be guarantee do
  ob name text chirp insight pool pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp insight guarantee platform ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp insight pool defective" be guarantee do

  su name chirp template request stage ob name map chirp request replacements in name text chirp template request template to name text chirp template request be instead do
  su name chirp template raw stage ob name text chirp template request for name chirp template mind to name text chirp template raw by num 0 atmost num 16 be write do
  su name chirp template stage to name text chirp template out be chirp template verify do
  ob name text chirp template out to name text chirp replacement template be text do

  su name chirp draft request stage ob name map chirp request replacements in name text chirp draft request template to name text chirp draft request be instead do
  su name chirp draft stage ob name text chirp draft request for name chirp draft mind to name text chirp out by num 0 atmost num 180 be write do
  su name chirp total letters verify stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 100 atmost num 280 from name text chirp out to name map chirp total letters verify do
  ob text of pass of chirp total letters verify to name text chirp total letters pass be text do
  su name chirp source thrust stage from text of ob of chirp source with text of ob of chirp out to name text chirp draft source thrust pass be chirp source thrust do
  ob text "true" to name text chirp draft pass be text do
  ob name text chirp total letters pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp draft pass be text do
  ob name text chirp draft source thrust pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp draft pass be text do
  ob name text chirp draft pass be equally from text false then
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be chirp draft retry do
  ob name text chirp draft pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp draft guarantee platform ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp draft defective" be guarantee do
  su name chirp out ret
prah

su name chirp manuscript from text source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name chirp source stage ob text of from of this to name text chirp source be text do
  su name chirp draft stage from text of ob of chirp source to name text manuscript out be chirp draft verify do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name chirp manuscript from filename source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name chirp source stage from filename of from of this become wo text to name text chirp source be read do
  su name chirp draft stage from text of ob of chirp source to name text manuscript out be chirp draft verify do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name manuscript as wo chirp from text source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name chirp manuscript stage from text of from of this to name text manuscript out be chirp manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name manuscript as wo chirp from filename source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name chirp manuscript stage from filename of from of this to name text manuscript out be chirp manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

exists su name chirp manuscript be export ya
exists su name manuscript as wo chirp be export ya
